Package: fiaplyr
Title: Interface to FIA Databases with 'dbplyr'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bryce", "Frank", , "bfrank70@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an S4 interface for querying, transforming, and
    aggregating Forest Inventory and Analysis (FIA) database tables with
    'dbplyr'. The package supports plot-, condition-, and tree-level
    workflows for building inventory summaries and post-stratified estimates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/brycefrank/fiaplyr
BugReports: https://github.com/brycefrank/fiaplyr/issues
